                                    </p>
                                    <p className="mt-2 font-semibold tabular-nums">
                                        Nouvel essai possible dans {lockoutRemaining} s
                                    </p>
                                    <div className="mt-2 h-1.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-danger-border" aria-hidden="true">
